{"id":"n82650-1-11","stage":5,"title":"틈새 · 裂缝","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82650-1-11-1","ko":"어디서 자꾸 찬바람이 들어오는 거지?","zh":"是哪里在不断让冷风灌进来啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"찬바람이","meaning":"冷风，寒气","explanation":"찬바람：冷风，寒气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"찬바람","audio":"/audio/3f0011aac265cd2b3e0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77639","senseId":"1","lemma":"찬바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찬바람이","audio":"/audio/ca5eeeb162b6efc16807.mp3"}},{"text":"들어오는","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어오는","audio":"/audio/845944696a4d8fd3ae5d.mp3"}},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거지","audio":"/audio/a9e973ff709d931a2b92.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"3f0011aac265cd2b","term":"찬바람","zh":"冷风，寒气","audio":"/audio/3f0011aac265cd2b3e0e.mp3","entryId":"77639","definition":"(喻义)非常寒冷、冰凉的气息或感觉。","pronunciation":["찬바람"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3543f64821705ae4450c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82650-1-11-2","ko":"저기 창문 틈새로 바람이 들어오나 봐.","zh":"看来是风从那边的窗户缝隙里进来的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"창문","meaning":"窗，窗户","explanation":"창문：窗，窗户。","readings":[{"term":"창문","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71809","senseId":"1","lemma":"창문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"창문","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3"}},{"text":"틈새로","meaning":"裂缝，缝隙","explanation":"틈새：裂缝，缝隙；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"틈새","audio":"/audio/2e42dd2ba930340b9bc2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82650","senseId":"1","lemma":"틈새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"틈새로","audio":"/audio/7f4ccb1dc96a18bcc5e5.mp3"}},{"text":"바람이","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Kor